# R / RStudio
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj.user
.DS_Store

# --- Raw third-party data --------------------------------------------------
# Both raw data sources may be redistributed:
#  - data-raw/policy/ : MIT-licensed (wtsong/china_mpshocks).
#  - data-raw/fx/     : IMF Exchange Rate Data, redistribution permitted under
#    the IMF "Use of IMF Data" terms with attribution + disclosure of the
#    BSP backfill transformation. See data-raw/fx/SOURCE_AND_LICENSE.md.
# Both are therefore kept under version control.

# Keep tables and figures under version control for supervisor review,
# but ignore any other generated output and the fitted-model cache.
output/*
!output/tables/
!output/figures/
output/models.rds
Archive.zip

# PDF companions ggsave()/save_fig() write alongside each figure's PNG. Only
# the PNGs have ever been tracked (see R/fig_theme.R); the PDFs are a
# per-render byproduct whose content depends on the local Cairo/font/ragg
# stack, so they are left untracked rather than churning the diff on every
# run_all.R run.
output/figures/*.pdf
